entries.en:
I should see who prayed
for the repose of my soul,
and who didn't.

Then when Jeong Hyeok returns
from the outpost line,
will you marry him as planned?

He can't get treatments
from regular hospitals,
so he must be using such facilities.

By the way, I told you that today, you should watch out
for what comes out of your mouth,
not what goes into your mouth.

Is it you? The guy
from the article about Se-ri? Now that you got photographed with Se-ri,
you feel like you're on top of the world.

if you think about it,
Comrade Al also came from South Korea. We are not completely innocent either.
Don't you think that's a double standard?
